---
routeKey: thanks
title: "Anfrage gesendet — DIWEBA"
description: "Ihre Anfrage ist eingegangen. Sie erhalten eine Antwort am nächsten Werktag."
noindex: true
---
{#
  /kontakt/danke/ — the real success page a visitor lands on after
  worker/index.ts's handleContact() redirects a successfully-sent
  submission here (303, see THANKS_PATH in that file). noindex is set both
  here and in routes.js's `thanks` entry (belt-and-braces, same as the
  route registry already enforces via base.njk's `self.noindex` check) —
  spec §9: a conversion confirmation returns 200 so a GA4 event can fire,
  but must never be indexable.

  Nothing on this page is reachable except by an actual successful POST to
  /api/contact — there is no link to it anywhere else on the site.
#}
{%- set c = contactPage[lang].thanks -%}
{%- set h = home[lang] -%}
<section class="row row--no-border" style="padding-block:clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem)">
  <div class="container stack" style="gap:18px;max-width:36em">
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3.25rem)">{{ c.heading }}</h1>
    <p class="text-soft" style="font-size:var(--text-lg);line-height:var(--leading-relaxed)">{{ c.body }}</p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ "home" | route(lang) }}">{{ c.back }}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
